{
  "entries": [
    {
      "id": "sparktraits:fast_reload",
      "tab": "TRAIT",
      "sourceModId": "sparktraits",
      "nameKey": "trait.sparktraits.fast_reload.name",
      "summaryKey": "trait.sparktraits.fast_reload.description",
      "pages": [
        {
          "blocks": [
            {
              "type": "paragraph",
              "text": "左轮手枪冷却更短，USEC 拉栓更快。警职词条，只会出现在老兵以外的警职身上（义警、法官、樱羽艾玛、控场专家、搜寻者、USEC）。"
            },
            {
              "type": "section",
              "text": "效果",
              "tone": "info"
            },
            {
              "type": "bullet",
              "text": "【左轮手枪】开枪后的冷却缩短 30%，义警从 10 秒缩短到 7 秒。可以和【快手】词条叠加。"
            },
            {
              "type": "bullet",
              "text": "USEC 的【AXMC 狙击步枪】拉栓时间从 2 秒缩短到 1.4 秒。"
            },
            {
              "type": "bullet",
              "text": "只对左轮手枪和 USEC 的狙击步枪有效，【德林加手枪】不受影响。"
            },
            {
              "type": "section",
              "text": "建议",
              "tone": "good"
            },
            {
              "type": "bullet",
              "text": "第一枪落空也能更快补枪。但每一枪都要确认目标，误杀的代价不会变小。"
            }
          ]
        }
      ],
      "ownerRoleIds": [
        "wathe:vigilante"
      ],
      "requiredModIds": [
        "sparktraits"
      ],
      "color": "#F4A261",
      "order": 910
    }
  ]
}
